es R a A z (Equation 4-6) where: D = Occupant diversity: the ratio of the system population to the sum of the zone populations, determined in accordance with Equation 4-7. D = P s (Equation 4-7) Σ all zones P z where: P s = System population: The total number of occupants in the area served by the system. For design purposes, P s shall be the maximum number of occupants expected to be concurrently in all zones served by the system."}]}
